 <name>usearch</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>In-process vector similarity search with USearch</summary>
 <description>In-process vector similarity search (HNSW) for PHP, backed by a
statically linked build of USearch 2.26.2. Exposes dense vector index creation,
multi-metric distance evaluation (Cosine, L2, InnerProduct, Haversine, etc.),
scalar quantization (F32, F16, I8, B1), in-memory and memory-mapped (view)
index persistence, and runtime SIMD dispatch (AVX-512, AVX2, NEON, SVE).</description>
