 </version>
 <stability>
  <release>devel</release>
  <api>devel</api>
 </stability>
 <license uri="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0">Apache-2.0</license>
 <notes>
Initial release of usearch-php:
- In-process HNSW vector similarity search on USearch 2.26.2
- Full core API: construct, add, search, get, contains, count, remove, rename, clear, reserve
- File persistence via save, load, and read-only mmap view
- Usearch\Metric and Usearch\Scalar int-backed enums
- Runtime SIMD dispatch preservation
- Multi-ABI PHP 8.3, 8.4, 8.5 support
 </notes>
